 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "You trusted in your beauty and played the whore",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 3.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Lavished your favors on every passerby",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Took garments and made gaudy shrines for them",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Used my gold and silver to make male images",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Set my oil and incense before these idols",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sacrificed your sons and daughters to the fire",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Did not remember the days of your youth",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When you were naked and kicking in your blood",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Hear the word of the Lord regarding you",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I will gather all your lovers against you",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Strip you naked before them in the square",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They will tear down your mound and lofty shrines",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Stone you and cut you with their swords",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will spend my wrath and my jealousy",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then I will be calm and no longer angry",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 2.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "You built a mound at the head of every street",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 5.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Degraded your beauty for every passerby",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Played the whore with the Egyptians and Assyria",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.93,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Multiplied your whorings with Chaldea too",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You scorned payment like a brazen prostitute",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Opposite of women who solicited love",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You are truly your mother's daughter indeed",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who despised her husband and her children",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Hear the word of the Lord regarding you",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will gather all your lovers against you",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Strip you naked before them in the square",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They will tear down your mound and lofty shrines",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Stone you and cut you with their swords",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will spend my wrath and my jealousy",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then I will be calm and no longer angry",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 3.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Your older sister Samaria lived to the north",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 7.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Your younger sister Sodom lived to the south",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You copied their abominations and ways",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Became more corrupt in all your deeds",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sodom was arrogant and overfed with ease",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Did not help the poor and the needy",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Samaria did not commit half your sins",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You made your sisters look righteous by contrast",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will restore the fortunes of them all",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 11.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "So you may bear your disgrace and be ashamed",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They will return to their former state",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And you will be a consolation to them",
   "heard": 8,
